      }
    }
  },
  "acceptance_checks": [
    "Today screen order is liturgical context, daily action, completion, readings, important Mass, reflection note.",
    "Small widget shows date/context and one action.",
    "Medium widget includes action plus Mass summary when available.",
    "Empty, offline, and stale-data states are specified.",
    "Widget tap opens Today.",
